Given markdown (Three words):
  One two three
Execute (Use the mapping):
  packadd brackets
  normal \bbiw
Expect todo (Three words with one bracketed):
  ⌜One⌟ two three

Given markdown (Three words):
  One two three
Execute (WORD forward then use the mapping):
  packadd brackets
  normal W\bbiw
Expect todo (Three words with one bracketed):
  One ⌜two⌟ three

Given markdown (Three words):
  One two three
Execute (2 WORDs forward then use the mapping):
  packadd brackets
  normal WW\bbiw
Expect todo (Three words with one bracketed):
  One two ⌜three⌟
